description: Bind a range widget to a JSON property
tags: $:/tags/wiki-test-spec
title: TestCases/RangeWidget/DataIndex
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki-multiple

title: Narrative

The index attribute stores the slider value in a JSON property. Move the slider to update volume, or use the button to update the property and watch the slider follow. The label property is preserved.
+
title: Output

<$range tiddler="Settings" index="volume" min="0" max="1" increment="0.1"/>

Volume: {{Settings##volume}}

Other property: {{Settings##label}}

<$button><$action-setfield $tiddler="Settings" $index="volume" $value="0.8"/>Set volume to 0.8</$button>
+
title: Settings
type: application/json

{"volume":"0.5","label":"Speaker"}
+
title: ExpectedResult

<input class="" max="1" min="0" step="0.1" type="range" value="0.5"><p>Volume: 0.5</p><p>Other property: Speaker</p><p><button class="">Set volume to 0.8</button></p>